  "design": {
    "idea": "First Optical Relay: cross the north gallery to defeat the Barnacle Sentry guarding the East Tide-Wheel pedal, drop tower_tide to low so the floating mirror-raft seats onto its brass cradle, and rotate it to 135 deg so the horizontal golden beam transforms blue straight into Floor Optic Well W1 (lighting relay_f1 and opening the North stair to r3).",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "sho",
    "teaches": "Powering Lighthouse Optic Wells (relay_f1..f3) by redirecting continuous beams through blue mirror-rafts.",
    "decisions": 7,
    "expert_s": 54,
    "reward": "relay_f1+cycle_2_to_r3",
    "why": "First vertical relay shaft lighting the floor Fresnel lens back in r1 and unlocking the Pier Ward stair.",
